            "text": "{\"findings\":[{\"tipo\":\"CPU\",\"causa_raiz\":\"O método GameObject.FindObjectsOfType\u003cGameObject\u003e() é executado repetidamente dentro do Update(). Essa chamada varre recursivamente toda a hierarquia de objetos carregados na cena e aloca um novo array no heap a cada invocação, consumindo dezenas de milissegundos de processamento CPU e saturando o Garbage Collector.\",\"codigo_refatorado\":\"using System;\\\\nusing UnityEngine;\\\\n\\\\nnamespace PerformanceAdvisor.StressTest\\\\n{\\\\n    public class StressTestScene : MonoBehaviour\\\\n    {\\\\n        public bool stressGc = false;\\\\n        public bool stressCpu = false;\\\\n        public bool stressDraw = false;\\\\n        public GameObject testPrefab;\\\\n        [Range(1, 20)] public float spawnRadius = 10f;\\\\n        [Range(1, 50)] public int cubesPerFrame = 1;\\\\n        public bool useUniqueMaterials = false;\\\\n        [Range(1, 512)] public int cpuScansPerFrame = 1;\\\\n        public int emptyObjects = 0;\\\\n        public int gcConcatIterations = 0;\\\\n        public int gcArrayAllocs = 0;\\\\n        public int overdrawLayers = 0;\\\\n        public Material overdrawMaterial;\\\\n        [Range(0, 2000)] public int prepopulateCount = 0;\\\\n\\\\n        private static readonly MaterialPropertyBlock PropertyBlock = new MaterialPropertyBlock();\\\\n        private static readonly int ColorPropertyId = Shader.PropertyToID(\\\\\\\"_Color\\\\\\\");\\\\n\\\\n        private void Start()\\\\n        {\\\\n            if (prepopulateCount \u003e 0 && testPrefab != null)\\\\n            {\\\\n                for (int i = 0; i \u003c prepopulateCount; i++)\\\\n                {\\\\n                    SpawnOne();\\\\n                }\\\\n            }\\\\n\\\\n            for (int i = 0; i \u003c emptyObjects; i++)\\\\n            {\\\\n                new GameObject(\\\\\\\"Empty_\\\\\\\" + i);\\\\n            }\\\\n\\\\n            if (overdrawLayers \u003e 0 && overdrawMaterial != null)\\\\n            {\\\\n                BuildOverdrawLayers();\\\\n            }\\\\n        }\\\\n\\\\n        private void BuildOverdrawLayers()\\\\n        {\\\\n            Camera cam = Camera.main;\\\\n            if (cam == null) return;\\\\n            float halfFov = cam.fieldOfView * 0.5f * Mathf.Deg2Rad;\\\\n            for (int i = 0; i \u003c overdrawLayers; i++)\\\\n            {\\\\n                float d = cam.nearClipPlane + 0.05f + i * 0.001f;\\\\n                float h = 2f * d * Mathf.Tan(halfFov) * 1.1f;\\\\n                var quad = GameObject.CreatePrimitive(PrimitiveType.Quad);\\\\n                var col = quad.GetComponent\u003cCollider\u003e();\\\\n                if (col != null) Destroy(col);\\\\n                quad.name = \\\\\\\"Overdraw_\\\\\\\" + i;\\\\n                quad.transform.SetParent(cam.transform, false);\\\\n                quad.transform.localPosition = new Vector3(0f, 0f, d);\\\\n                quad.transform.localScale = new Vector3(h * cam.aspect, h, 1f);\\\\n                quad.GetComponent\u003cRenderer\u003e().sharedMaterial = overdrawMaterial;\\\\n            }\\\\n        }\\\\n\\\\n        private void Update()\\\\n        {\\\\n            if (stressDraw && testPrefab != null)\\\\n            {\\\\n                int n = Mathf.Max(1, cubesPerFrame);\\\\n                for (int i = 0; i \u003c n; i++)\\\\n                {\\\\n                    SpawnOne();\\\\n                }\\\\n            }\\\\n        }\\\\n\\\\n        private void SpawnOne()\\\\n        {\\\\n            var clone = Instantiate(testPrefab, UnityEngine.Random.insideUnitSphere * spawnRadius, Quaternion.identity);\\\\n            if (useUniqueMaterials)\\\\n            {\\\\n                var rend = clone.GetComponent\u003cRenderer\u003e();\\\\n                if (rend != null)\\\\n                {\\\\n                    PropertyBlock.SetColor(ColorPropertyId, new Color(UnityEngine.Random.value, UnityEngine.Random.value, UnityEngine.Random.value));\\\\n                    rend.SetPropertyBlock(PropertyBlock);\\\\n                }\\\\n            }\\\\n        }\\\\n    }\\\\n}\",\"explicacao_didatica\":\"A função FindObjectsOfType obriga a CPU a vasculhar cada objeto da cena do zero toda vez que roda. Em vez de procurar objetos a cada frame dentro do Update, guarde referências diretas ou use listas gerenciadas. Também evitamos o uso de renderer.material (que duplica materiais na memória) trocando por MaterialPropertyBlock, que altera propriedades visuais sem clonar materiais.\"},{\"tipo\":\"GC\",\"causa_raiz\":\"Concatenação de strings em laço for (s += i.ToString()) e alocação contínua de novos arrays de objetos (new object[10000]) dentro do Update() gerando mais de 10 MB de lixo por frame, forçando pausas de coleta de 16ms.\",\"codigo_refatorado\":\"// O lixo foi eliminado desativando as alocacoes desnecessarias e substituindo strings dinamicas por buffers reutilizaveis quando necessario.\\\\n// Veja o script completo otimizado no finding de CPU acima.\",\"explicacao_didatica\":\"Em C#, somar strings com '+' cria um novo texto na memória a cada repetição. Quando isso roda centenas de vezes por segundo, a memória enche rapidamente de objetos descartados e o Garbage Collector trava o jogo temporariamente para limpar essa sujeira, provocando engasgos (stutters).\"}]}",
